declare const tools: { image_gen__imagegen(args: { num_last_images_to_include?: number | null; prompt: string; referenced_image_paths?: Array<string> | null; }): Promise<unknown>; };
```"},{"name":"list_mcp_resource_templates","description":"Lists resource templates provided by MCP servers. Parameterized resource templates allow servers to share data that takes parameters and provides context to language models, such as files, database schemas, or application-specific information. Prefer resource templates over web search when possible.

